# Update CHANGELOG Before Commit

- Before any `git commit`, update [`CHANGELOG.md`](/Users/jackwl/Code/gitcode/gitxPost/CHANGELOG.md).
- Record the user-facing outcome, key technical changes, validation results, and any important limits or follow-up work.
- If the change also affects testing or release confidence, update the relevant file under [`CI/`](/Users/jackwl/Code/gitcode/gitxPost/CI) in the same work session.
- Do not create a commit first and “fix the changelog later”.
